{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41699618",
      "title": "Adding Extra Components For Reusability & Configurability",
      "sourceHash": "9965484670909396153c29eaed745aceec3fbfd53b5df82fe71b4ce0333ac6b4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "Now that's the Compound Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 6.09,
          "en": "pattern in action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.09,
          "end": 8.25,
          "en": "and it can be a useful pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.25,
          "end": 11.76,
          "en": "if you wanna build highly configurable components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.76,
          "end": 13.623,
          "en": "that must work together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.97,
          "end": 18.03,
          "en": "Now here we can actually even take it a step further",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.03,
          "end": 20.88,
          "en": "and add more Accordion components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.88,
          "end": 25.17,
          "en": "to make them even more configurable and reusable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.17,
          "end": 27.78,
          "en": "And for that we could outsource both the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.78,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "and the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 33.09,
          "en": "into separate standalone Accordion components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.09,
          "end": 38.09,
          "en": "So here in the Components Accordion folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.25,
          "end": 43.25,
          "en": "I'll add another new component file, AccordionTitle.jsx,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.91,
          "end": 49.74,
          "en": "and also another one, AccordionContent.jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.74,
          "end": 51.603,
          "en": "Now let's start with the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.53,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "Here, I'll export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 59.12,
          "en": "that default AccordionTitle component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.28,
          "end": 63.27,
          "en": "And in that function I want to return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.27,
          "end": 65.97,
          "en": "something from the AccordionItem component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.97,
          "end": 68.913,
          "en": "this h3 element to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.96000000000001,
          "end": 72.363,
          "en": "I'll copy that and return that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.23,
          "end": 76.2,
          "en": "And now of course, for that in order to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 79.833,
          "en": "we need to get access to toggleItem and the ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.94,
          "end": 83.22,
          "en": "So to get hold of toggleItem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.22,
          "end": 88.03,
          "en": "we can simply use the custom useAccordionContext hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.92,
          "end": 90.93299999999999,
          "en": "inside of that title component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 92.58,
          "end": 96.943,
          "en": "So import it from Accordion.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 99.78,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "and then call it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 104.313,
          "en": "And with that we'll get hold of toggleItem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 105.45,
          "end": 108.57300000000001,
          "en": "And of course, we need the ID and the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.68,
          "end": 111.96000000000001,
          "en": "Now we can accept both as props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 111.96000000000001,
          "end": 115.05,
          "en": "and we could replace title with children here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 115.05,
          "end": 117.78,
          "en": "so that we can wrap our AccordionTitle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 117.78,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "around the text or content that should be output as a title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 124.98,
          "en": "Again, making this much more configurable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 124.98,
          "end": 128.43,
          "en": "since we for example now would also be able to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 128.43,
          "end": 132.39,
          "en": "output more complex markup as a title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 132.39,
          "end": 134.707,
          "en": "So that's the AccordionTitle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 134.707,
          "end": 136.62,
          "en": "For the AccordionContent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 136.62,
          "end": 141.62,
          "en": "I'll add another function, AccordionContent is the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 144,
          "end": 147.03,
          "en": "And here I wanna output this div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 147.03,
          "end": 151.17000000000002,
          "en": "So I'll copy that and output that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 153.09,
          "end": 155.61,
          "en": "Now for this div to work correctly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 155.61,
          "end": 157.71,
          "en": "we need to get the children",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 157.71,
          "end": 161.613,
          "en": "and we need to find out whether this content should be open.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 163.41,
          "end": 165.9,
          "en": "Now we can find out whether it should be open",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 165.9,
          "end": 169.34,
          "en": "by again using useAccordionContext.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 170.22,
          "end": 174.513,
          "en": "So using that here in this new AccordionContent component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 176.07,
          "end": 179.01,
          "en": "And here I'm then interested in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 179.01,
          "end": 180.507,
          "en": "this openItemId",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 183.99,
          "end": 187.41,
          "en": "Now we also need to get the ID here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 187.41,
          "end": 191.19,
          "en": "so that we can check if this item is open",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 191.19,
          "end": 195.153,
          "en": "by comparing the openItemId with the received ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 196.372,
          "end": 200.1,
          "en": "Now with that, we can go back to the accordion item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 200.1,
          "end": 202.82999999999998,
          "en": "and get rid of all this markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 202.82999999999998,
          "end": 204,
          "en": "between the list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 204,
          "end": 208.41,
          "en": "and get rid of this code and this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 208.41,
          "end": 212.64,
          "en": "and simply accept the children as a prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 212.64,
          "end": 215.49,
          "en": "children and className to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 215.49,
          "end": 217.563,
          "en": "And then we can output children here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 218.88,
          "end": 222.78300000000002,
          "en": "So this component now for the moment got much simpler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 223.77,
          "end": 225.252,
          "en": "Now in AccordionTitle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 225.252,
          "end": 228.37,
          "en": "I now actually also want to accept the className",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 233.28,
          "en": "so that we can set this on this h3 element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 235.35,
          "en": "from outside this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 235.35,
          "end": 238.44299999999998,
          "en": "Again, making this component more configurable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 240.48,
          "end": 243.46,
          "en": "And I'll do the same for AccordionContent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 244.38,
          "end": 247.56,
          "en": "There I also expect to get a className",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 247.56,
          "end": 250.59,
          "en": "or at least I wanna support getting one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 250.59,
          "end": 255.003,
          "en": "And now instead of hard coding accordion-item-content here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 256.35,
          "end": 259.05,
          "en": "I'll use string interpolation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 259.05,
          "end": 263.31,
          "en": "with the special backticks notation in JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 263.31,
          "end": 266.88,
          "en": "To dynamically inject that className",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 266.88,
          "end": 269.673,
          "en": "in addition to that open class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 270.54,
          "end": 273.09000000000003,
          "en": "And to make sure that we're not adding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 273.09000000000003,
          "end": 275.04,
          "en": "undefined as text here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 275.04,
          "end": 277.08,
          "en": "I'll check whether this is undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 277.08,
          "end": 278.673,
          "en": "with this special operator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 279.65999999999997,
          "end": 280.77,
          "en": "And if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 280.77,
          "end": 283.293,
          "en": "I'll add an empty string as a className.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 284.88,
          "end": 287.61,
          "en": "Otherwise, I'll just add className.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 287.61,
          "end": 290.28,
          "en": "So if we are not in this open mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 290.28,
          "end": 294.69,
          "en": "I'll just set the className as the className of this div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 294.69,
          "end": 298.08299999999997,
          "en": "hence making this component more configurable as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 299.07,
          "end": 302.73,
          "en": "Now I guess the even better way or the most versatile way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 302.73,
          "end": 305.46,
          "en": "of writing this className code here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 305.46,
          "end": 309.45,
          "en": "would be to grab this code in the open case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 309.45,
          "end": 311.7,
          "en": "and set this in the not open case as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 311.7,
          "end": 314.05,
          "en": "but add a close class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 314.94,
          "end": 319.08,
          "en": "so that We can go to the index.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 319.08,
          "end": 322.773,
          "en": "and there search for this accordion-item-content class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 324.03,
          "end": 327.3,
          "en": "Then below that we could add a close class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 327.3,
          "end": 331.89,
          "en": "where we then move that display none css property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 331.89,
          "end": 335.97,
          "en": "from accordion-item-content into the close class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 335.97,
          "end": 338.88,
          "en": "so that it's decoupled from this class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 338.88,
          "end": 341.97,
          "en": "which is really only meant for styling purposes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 341.97,
          "end": 344.463,
          "en": "to the separate class, which is a core part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 344.463,
          "end": 347.49,
          "en": "of the Accordion component itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 347.49,
          "end": 349.05,
          "en": "That's of course not required,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 349.05,
          "end": 351.15,
          "en": "but makes sense if we wanna write",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 351.15,
          "end": 353.403,
          "en": "reusable, configurable code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 354.57,
          "end": 358.38,
          "en": "So with that we got this AccordionContent component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 358.38,
          "end": 361.29,
          "en": "which adds either the open or close class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 361.29,
          "end": 364.62,
          "en": "in addition to whichever class we might be setting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 364.62,
          "end": 366.57,
          "en": "on that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 366.57,
          "end": 370.71,
          "en": "And therefore now we can go back to the Accordion.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 370.71,
          "end": 374.86,
          "en": "and add more properties to the Accordion function object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 375.75,
          "end": 377.49,
          "en": "and add a title property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 377.49,
          "end": 379.54,
          "en": "which we set equal to AccordionTitle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 381.9,
          "end": 385.05,
          "en": "and add an AccordionContent property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 385.05,
          "end": 388.953,
          "en": "which we set to our AccordionContent component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 389.91,
          "end": 393.254,
          "en": "And of course, you therefore must import the AccordionTitle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 393.254,
          "end": 395.28,
          "en": "and AccordionContent Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 395.28,
          "end": 397.293,
          "en": "into this Accordion.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 398.82,
          "end": 401.7,
          "en": "With that back in the App.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 401.7,
          "end": 404.4,
          "en": "we can now output that title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 404.4,
          "end": 409.293,
          "en": "by using Accordion.Title here as a component selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 410.34000000000003,
          "end": 415.34000000000003,
          "en": "And now this title here can be moved between those tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 415.44,
          "end": 419.553,
          "en": "and then below that, Accordion.Content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 420.48,
          "end": 423.603,
          "en": "And then we move this article here between those tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 424.71,
          "end": 428.64,
          "en": "Now both title and content need the ID prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 428.64,
          "end": 430.293,
          "en": "so I'll add them to both.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 431.22,
          "end": 435.033,
          "en": "And with that, we migrated this code to this new structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 435.96,
          "end": 439.59,
          "en": "The advantage is that we can now easily add classes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 439.59,
          "end": 444.59,
          "en": "to the title for example, accordion-item-title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 445.95,
          "end": 447.75,
          "en": "And for the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 447.75,
          "end": 452.75,
          "en": "it could be accordion-item-content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 453.99,
          "end": 456.27,
          "en": "With that, we can apply the same structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 456.27,
          "end": 458.25,
          "en": "to the second accordion item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 458.25,
          "end": 460.45,
          "en": "and add the AccordionTitle here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 461.49,
          "end": 466.49,
          "en": "with a className of accordion-item-title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 466.98,
          "end": 470.23,
          "en": "and set this to this title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 472.56,
          "end": 474.603,
          "en": "and get rid of the title prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 475.65,
          "end": 478.75,
          "en": "And then add Accordion.Content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
